- Granite upgrade (EV-028) status — apakah sudah deployed ke mainnet atau masih testnet, timeline exact
- Fault proof system (EV-030) — kapan Cannon/OP Challenger expected mainnet deployment, Stage 2 decentralization target date
- Early investor/VC sebelum Series B (seed, Series A) — tidak tercakup di events, perlu Crunchbase/PitchBook
- Security audit reports detail per upgrade (Bedrock, Canyon, Ecotone, Fjord) — link ke PDF audit reports spesifik
- OP tokenomics detail: TGE allocation breakdown, vesting schedules, treasury management — tidak fully covered
- Citizens' House badge holder selection process dan jumlah — tidak detailed
- Regulatory considerations: Cayman Foundation compliance, OP token securities law analysis — tidak covered